Cell["\<\
We can check that the bare propagators are the inverses of the bare two-point \
functions. For the contractions we use some rules:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.971693155332855*^9, 3.971693172988844*^9}, {
  3.976971988313451*^9, 3.9769719923253727`*^9}, {3.977546163725849*^9, 
