Cell["\<\
The left-hand side has the same structure as the bare two-point function on \
the right but amended with dressings. Thus, projection onto the bare \
dressings will show that the projectors also project onto A and B.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.977838029793868*^9, 3.9778380371657743`*^9}, {
  3.977838291074437*^9, 3.97783833024155*^9}, {3.9778384411870613`*^9, 
